# LoopOps Avatar App

React Native mobile app for **Actinver** talking-head avatar. Not the LoopOps web app or marketing website.

## Stack

- React Native 0.87, React 19, TypeScript
- HeyGen **Live Avatar** ([docs.liveavatar.com](https://docs.liveavatar.com/))
- Backend: Python or TypeScript, LangChain / LangGraph, **Gemini** LLM
- Investment tools: portfolio lookup, news scraping, risk-tier product search, guided transaction flows

## Interaction modes

1. **Chat mode** — typed messages, text replies, optional avatar lip-sync
2. **Voice mode** — speech in/out via avatar session, hands-free conversation

Both modes share the same agent backend and session context.

## Structure

```
src/
├── theme/           # Design tokens (tokens.ts, getTheme)
├── services/        # API client + backend calls
└── features/
    ├── avatar/      # HeyGen Live Avatar integration
    ├── chat/        # Chat UI, composer, message list
    └── voice/       # Voice capture + playback orchestration
knowledge/           # Architecture docs (read before coding)
DESIGN.md            # Agent-readable token mirror
```

## Commands

```bash
npm start            # Metro
npm run ios
npm run android
npm test
```

